ich could prevent my teammate from playing out their last 2 cards. By passing, my teammate maintains initiative and can likely win the game.\n\nReason:\nMy teammate has only 2 cards left and currently controls the play. By passing, I allow them to maintain control and play out their remaining cards to win the game. If I play any card now, control passes to the landlord (who has 5 cards), potentially blocking my teammate from finishing. As a peasant, helping my teammate win is just as good as winning myself.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
